[{"title":"夏词 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"绿街迎夏夹衣更，玉秤称来并体轻。\n人笑同心是天定，一同欢喜一同惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40203,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏词 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"投我灵瓜美似饴，分明冰雪个人肌。\n早知郑灼然心火，此物清凉可暂医。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40204,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏词 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"鹦鹉当窗不敢呼，玉钩响处卷帘无。\n风前冉冉轻云影，一幅杨妃出浴图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40205,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏词 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"小姑新制碧筒香，强捉檀奴尽一觞。\n亲剥莲蓬瑩似玉，背灯佯置镜台旁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40206,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋词 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"小病恹恹过暑天，嫩黄姿色谢华铅。\n今朝薄傅芙蓉粉，省得郎看瘦可怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40207,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋词 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"红墙绿绦谢娘家，金凰开齐五色霞。\n楼角一钩黄月淡，麻姑爪上看桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40208,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋词 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"洗空脂粉晚妆成，真色看来倍有情。\n更喜一弯心字月，玉人眉额照秋清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40209,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋词 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"洞房轻把玉屏推，手握青丝下镜台。\n知为阿侬生日到，多情先日送花来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40210,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"午梦","author":"孙原湘","text":"长日因循候，閒房寂静时。\n倦解樊昵侍，计遣阿侯嬉。\n委地垂银押，当窗隐画丝。\n近前来冉冉，却立故迟迟。\n佩任湘裙妥，钗从翠鬓欹。\n蒙茸珍火齐，绰约献冰肌。\n侧耳风声过，关心竹影移。\n喜多翻震荡，力弱为惊疑。\n婉转花频就，阑珊蝶已疲。\n暂推无妄疾，深负有情痴。\n吃吃思前度，惺惺订后期。\n难成偏好梦，惆怅定如斯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40211,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"孙原湘","text":"雀炉烟穗袅黄昏，月过回廊乍掩门。\n虫覆叶深栖迹稳，蝶藏花小受香温。\n风鬟细闪珠灯影，雪腕微沾玉露痕。\n如此风情如此夜，一回相见一消魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40212,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"缝履","author":"孙原湘","text":"绿华传履制玲珑，珍重寒闺妙手功。\n晓箧豫分金线碧，夜窗频剔玉釭红。\n回肠默转回针处，密意潜含密缕中。\n著向閒阶须护惜，祇缘缝缀费春葱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40213,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"评梅","author":"孙原湘","text":"东阁南枝第一春，阿谁配得藐姑神。\n无心自与梅花品，半晌低颜不应人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40214,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨阻 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"黄昏独自下帘栊，挑尽银釭不肯红。\n有限清欢好时节，可堪抛掷雨声中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40215,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨阻 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"料卿知我忆卿真，绣被难安转侧身。\n听尽漏声还听雨，绿窗同是未眠人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40216,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨阻 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"闭户沉沉长绿莎，隔条街巷抵银河。\n一宵两处芭蕉上，不敌相思泪点多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40217,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨阻 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"兼旬梅雨苦如年，霁后晴云火欲然。\n雨即阻人晴亦阻，天公难作是情天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40218,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨阻 其五","author":"孙原湘","text":"相期隔日到妆台，苦被金闺女伴猜。\n如此炎官张火伞，迎朝触热为谁来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40219,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤寄所思 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"怕检罗衣旧日香，怕登楼阁睹斜阳。\n眼前事事皆堪哭，特借飞花恸一场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40220,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤寄所思 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"旁挠欢计阻良缘，中道风波岂偶然。\n我痛世人皆欲杀，不如卿有一人怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40221,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙梦 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"灯昏如梦月沉沉，曲折仙源许恣寻。\n细草生香迷洞口，片云含雨阁花阴。\n捣霜玉杵愁轻重，濯锦银河试浅深。\n十二万年今夕事，一回追忆定沾襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40222,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙梦 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"绛蜡生珠泪未挑，石鸡无奈应春潮。\n合欢慢揭青绫帐，团聚从吹紫玉箫。\n洞草尚含仙露湿，峡花犹带梦云摇。\n风光瞥去馍糊甚，才著思量似昨朝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40223,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答怨","author":"孙原湘","text":"百尺红楼一寸诚，愿随飞絮入檐楹。\n焚山终想求毛女，抱柱何辞作尾生。\n薄怒音词深似笑，过防心胆易成惊。\n佯推故却应须会，不负初盟肯负情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40224,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答羞","author":"孙原湘","text":"干金一刻价无酬，斗帐明姿映烛羞。\n峡里云行原是梦，洞中霜煖不知秋。\n抱香眠蝶忘朝暮，罥树飞花惜去留。\n谁把鸳鸯颠倒配，青天易补恨难休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40225,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答疑","author":"孙原湘","text":"阳台声息误传闻，苦寄连波锦字文。\n莲座久皈香一瓣，梅花敢议白三分。\n有星偶近天边月，为雨原无峡外云。\n沟水东西羞薄倖，锦衾长守卓文君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40226,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓妆","author":"孙原湘","text":"水精帘下晓风凉，委地春云五尺长。\n容易偷窥殊出浴，最难亲见是残妆。\n愿为花朵依鬟侧，想到钗声堕枕旁。\n待与侍儿商略取，红梳梳下几丝香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40227,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小字","author":"孙原湘","text":"谢公最小女偏怜，小字呼来定绛仙。\n一月回悬珠树朗，百花都让玉梅妍。\n疗饥自喜忘并日，消渴何辞为损年。\n每向画眉窗下见，匡庐只在镜台前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40228,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"排次","author":"孙原湘","text":"姊妹行中最下肩，女儿星次斗牛边。\n数来指节螺纹遍，翻到眉图月晕妍。\n辽后香词书宛转，丁娘丽曲索缠绵。\n宋宫谢女原排十，倾国偏推第一仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40229,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生辰","author":"孙原湘","text":"十日清和未改春，玉厨樱笋作生辰。\n问年愁误波斯女，降日应推洛水神。\n屈指浣花须下九，当头弦月倚初旬。\n金盘香露前朝聍，浴罢如来浴美人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40230,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病悰","author":"孙原湘","text":"得遂幽期病转深，梅花开日到如今。\n香盟纵结鸳鸯带，好梦难温翡翠衾。\n千尺水深通素札，一重山远隔罗襟。\n料无灵药能医治，愿化西天并命禽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40231,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋窗","author":"孙原湘","text":"纸窗芦帘玉放光，朝朝线帖与针箱。\n腰间欢喜潜松带，骨里鲜妍任毁妆。\n画槛凭时禽注眼，绣鞋行处蝶随香。\n太真瘦了春风面，一种秋魂化海棠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40232,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佳人","author":"孙原湘","text":"玉梅花下访云窝，坐对春山蹙翠蛾。\n幽暗房栊听雨久，暖香屏障避风多。\n论诗反索郎吟絮，作计閒教婢补萝。\n踪迹自疏情自密，趁人回首注娇波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40233,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"妒阻","author":"孙原湘","text":"妒眼如丛集满身，祇容相见罢相亲。\n私书拌灭怀中字，幽恨难瞒镜里颦。\n豆蔻含苞香触手，樱桃垂熟味沾唇。\n当初只道寻常事，犹苦消魂未得真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40234,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幽窗纪事","author":"孙原湘","text":"洞房清昼似黄昏，却下重帘掩上门。\n威闪星眸含薄怒，妒传风语表深恩。\n鬓梢花朵防欹侧，舌本茶香恣吐吞。\n容易铃声惊蛱蝶，已消孤闷未消魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40235,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"记言 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"胆娘小胆却多情，鹦鹉才呼便吃惊。\n错过今生好时节，泥人苦苦订来生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40236,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"记言 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"今生也算宿缘深，花纵分枝却一心。\n脩作人间真伉俪，相怜转恐不如今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40237,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨代所思书闷 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"蓝桥咫尺水盈盈，错过花朝月又明。\n如此相思容易老，一生几度见云英。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40238,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨代所思书闷 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"梦隔心悬又十朝，绿窗风雨坐无聊。\n九天屈注银湾水，那得凭空现鹊桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40239,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨代所思书闷 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"闷掩纱窗盼晓晴，几回错认画帘声。\n玉阶细数沉沉滴，怨了东风怨薄情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40240,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泣别 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"屡拣行期未有期，者番不道果临歧。\n纵教齧臂坚盟约，无奈惊心重别离。\n兰弱讵能胜远道，橘移还恐变芳姿。\n一尊拌醉花前死，魂魄随卿好护持。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40241,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泣别 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"宁教生死隔幽关，远别情怀较死难。\n人到去时看越好，泪无挥处怨尤酸。\n即防永诀诚多虑，聊订前期强自宽。\n留得两身憔悴在，相思祇隔路漫漫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40242,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泣别 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"媪鬟催送上屏轩，折向空房又几番。\n十步九回犹道速，一辞千嘱未嫌烦。\n鬓梢花朵从欹堕，奁侧绒书任乱翻。\n最是关心裙带系，玉郎亲赠别时言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40243,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泣别 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"深闺从未涉关河，送上扁舟恨若何。\n忍泪翻将词劝慰，耐心须保体安和。\n相看每觉消魂尽，屡见原愁折福多。\n暂别留些缘分在，镜台他日细消磨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40244,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"个人生日","author":"孙原湘","text":"红药年时照绮寮，个人生日是今朝。\n留宾每取头网试，拜佛亲将意可烧。\n萝屋补苴原不易，兰闺行役太无聊。\n重来响屧回廊下，竹影禽声总寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40245,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟夜","author":"孙原湘","text":"寻常小别上兰舟，回首山城见玉楼。\n今夕依然开画桨，前行不觉过芳洲。\n如何枕上醒孤梦，翻忆闺中作远游。\n听尽船头风与水，绿波东下泪西流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40246,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小别","author":"孙原湘","text":"送远悲犹在，离情此又并。\n暂迷三里雾，如隔一重城。\n密意传眸子，归期订尾生。\n临行手三反，知我定知卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40247,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如约志喜 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"临行坚说莫归迟，只许匆匆半月离。\n不道芳心偏记得，果然不负玉郎期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40248,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如约志喜 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"为探消息过卿居，果见明妆出绮疏。\n众里相逢先问讯，别时清恙近何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40249,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如约志喜 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"守约如山定不更，玉蟾三五證前盟。\n笑郎枉抱痴情在，准备桥头作尾生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40250,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如约志喜 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"别不多时话已多，香肩斜倚注横波。\n问郎他日天涯去，倘负归期待若何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40251,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起","author":"孙原湘","text":"一番偎傍一凄其，若个深恩得似伊。\n怜我病馀宜自爱，怕侬情重转相离。\n无由汤药亲身奉，只是衾裯彻夜思。\n见面但知郎瘦了，为郎消瘦却谁知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40252,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"妄语","author":"孙原湘","text":"绿窗痴语太无聊，妄想重生比玉箫。\n便等十年卿稚小，可知双鬓我飘萧。\n浮萍纵记前生准，并蒂终嫌隔世遥。\n留取悲愁缘分在，且图一见一魂消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40253,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幽踪 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"湘帘窣地护幽房，更借屏山一曲傏。\n为道狂心须自敛，漫云私语尽无妨。\n潜踪尚恐衣翻角，侧耳频猜屧过廊。\n重揭镜奁看鬓影，黄花手整绿云傍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40254,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幽踪 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"漫把秋花较若何，祇应人月比姮娥。\n日华映面空脂粉，云叶裁衣厌绮罗。\n骨秀未容粗领略，情高常苦费猜摩。\n今生幸不谐鸳牒，暂遇犹愁折福多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40255,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长恨辞 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"秾华一树委千春，顿失蛾眉绝代颦。\n呕血但知呼负负，回身犹想抱真真。\n温柔尽折三生福，惊恐虚劳十载神。\n一恸灵床还未敢，自怜终属薄情人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40256,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长恨辞 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"病中密誓泪纷纷，细喘如丝语不分。\n到死未能忘子建，佗生应得配参军。\n玉箫果许常为媵，神女何辞暂化云。\n只是费伊方寸血，相如新诔卓文君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40257,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长恨辞 其三","author":"孙原湘","text":"听到伤心伏枕辞，如何忍得泪千丝。\n六州已铸今生错，万劫难消此愿痴。\n眼看神娥奔月去，魂愁天女下凡迟。\n不关贪守重生约，正恐轻生转负伊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40258,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长恨辞 其四","author":"孙原湘","text":"花香月色旧阑干，不忍重经况忍看。\n是我心知天必忌，为卿泪滴地无乾。\n浑如梦里还寻梦，虚被欢称未尽欢。\n从此一双红豆颗，抛沉碧海恨漫漫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40259,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"总悼一首","author":"孙原湘","text":"王夫人与管夫人，湘水神还洛水神。\n身到碧空齐解脱，手拈红豆独酸辛。\n愁丝日绕诗中絮，泪迹时沾画里筠。\n欲报怜才恩似海，此生情海愿沉沦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40260,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阁笔","author":"孙原湘","text":"知音难得况蛾眉，手摔瑶琴谢子期。\n宋璟怕题梅萼赋，杜陵悲撤海棠诗。\n抽毫作诔循遗教，分俸营斋托诡辞。\n我亦怜才非好色，料无人识有天知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40261,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题和萧百堂 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"镜中春浪洗朝霞，抛闪风情与月华。\n不道负心真似铁，从来薄命定如花。\n桥头误问巡官卜，江上虚猜估客槎。\n帘捲西风还怅望，萧萧落叶满天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40262,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题和萧百堂 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"三年一信盼归迟，消息传来总可疑。\n筝柱忽移哀雁调，钗梁偏罥喜蛛丝。\n连宵梦好都无准，竟日妆成转自嗤。\n小婢不知前计左，只催开镜画新眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40263,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再和百堂 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"裙剪湘云佩紫霞，春风消息露年华。\n愁来不忍看残月，痴绝还思葬落花。\n有器难收倾地水，无程可纪上天槎。\n姻缘只好如鸿燕，海北江南各一涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40264,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再和百堂 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"果然重到不嫌迟，无奈空言祇益疑。\n痴愿莫真成马角，愁身早已入蚕丝。\n强为排解翻添恨，待觅商量恐受嗤。\n听得邻娃倚夫婿，教依新样画蛾眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40265,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"帐檐梅花 其一","author":"孙原湘","text":"一重雾縠一重纱，写出前身萼绿华。\n毕竟帷中看不见，依然暖玉当梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40266,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"帐檐梅花 其二","author":"孙原湘","text":"罗帷春风偷揭开，寿阳妆额尚慵抬。\n玉钩挂起分明看，也当巡檐索笑来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40267,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金陵女校书谢玉独居秋影楼洗妆谢客余与张香严秀才访之煮茗清谭殊有高致王脩微卞玉京一流人也临别留赠","author":"孙原湘","text":"美人从古怕妆残，邀宠争妍到此难。\n要卜倾心谁妾爱，独将真色与人看。\n轻身祇恐奔归月，清气偏宜坐近兰。\n我有无穷天壤恨，为卿鸳牒也心寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40268,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏美人屧上絮","author":"孙原湘","text":"托迹红帮线绿边，步来香土欲成莲。\n此生不作沾泥相，慧业能参自足禅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40269,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感蝶","author":"孙原湘","text":"庄周幻梦为蝴蝶，毕竟风流梦是空。\n争似青陵台下魄，一生酣梦万花中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40270,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"美人初度","author":"孙原湘","text":"如君竟体似芳莲，生在莲花一日前。\n诗主性灵空倚傍，情缘洒脱愈缠绵。\n巧思几越银河界，好梦常依璧月边。\n绣佛灯明齐下拜，比肩人恰似同年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":40271,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]